            <description><![CDATA[
<h2>See the whole position</h2>
<p>Positions and movers now tell you more at a glance.</p>
<ul>
    <li><strong>Same stock, one row.</strong> A stock held in several portfolios shows once, with total shares, average price and P&amp;L. Click it to see each portfolio's position.</li>
    <li><strong>What happened this week.</strong> On 7D, 1M and 1Y the change tile and the movers show how much each stock gained or lost you over that period.</li>
</ul>
